    "text": "In young&#39;s double slit experiment, the fringe width is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>. If the entire arrangement is placed in water of refractive index <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, then the fringe width becomes (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mm</mi></math>)",
